                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "Refunded. \n\nThe idea is a cool one but not being able to actually drive the taxi is a massive let down. Especially as no where on the videos or store page mentions this.\n\nI went into this expecting a VR version of Cloud Punk from the screens and vids but a better description would be a taxi version of Cyber Cafe, where the bread and butter of the games game play comes from passenger conversations with a few mechanics in place to try and distract you (eg. gunk on the windows or a slow car ahead) requiring a quick flick of the wipers switch or press of the horn.\n\nIf (like me) you are after a VR hover taxi experience where you fly a taxi to pick up fairs then this game is not for you.\nIf you want a taxi based VR game in the style of  'Papers Please' then I'd say give it a try as it might be up your street.",
